#: main.cpp:107
msgid ""
"<qt>Here you can change your personal information, which will be used, for "
"instance, in mail programs and word processors. You can change your login "
"password by clicking <em>Change Password...</em>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Equí puede camudar la so información personal, que s'usará en programes "
"de corréu y procesadores de testu, por exemplu. Puede camudar la so "
"contraseña d'usuariu calcando <em>Camudar la contraseña...</em>.</qt>"

#: main.cpp:121
msgid ""
"A program error occurred: the internal program 'kdepasswd' could not be "
"found. You will not be able to change your password."
msgstr ""
"Hebo un fallu del programa: nun pudo atopase'l programa internu «kdepasswd». "
"Nun podrá camudar la so contraseña."

